## Plan

- **New Recording Repository** – manages audio files on disk (list, delete).
- **Refactored ViewModel** – holds a list of saved recordings; `stopRecording()` merely saves the WAV file; transcription is triggered manually for a selected recording.
- **Redesigned Record Screen** – a record button plus a list of saved audio clips; tapping a clip offers “Transcribe” / “Translate” / Delete.
- **Navigation** – unchanged (Home, Record, Notes, Settings), but the “Record” tab is now the audio studio.

Below are all the updated/new files.

