## ✅ Summary of Changes

- **Decoupled recording from transcription** – pressing Stop now only saves the audio file; no transcription is performed automatically.
- **New Recording list** – the “Record” screen shows a list of all saved audio clips.
- **Manual transcription** – tap a recording to choose “Transcribe” or “Translate”, which runs the Whisper engine on demand.
- **Result & save** – the transcribed text appears in the dialog; you can save it to a note as before.
- **No changes to C++/JNI, model loading, or note management** – everything else remains identical.

Now you control exactly when and which recording to process – no more unexpected real‑time transcription.
